Upstream-Name: weiler
Source: https://github.com/masterxq/weiler
Comment: The game rules, the AI and the file formats are a frozen copy of
 Return to the Roots (https://github.com/Return-To-The-Roots/s25client and
 its submodules, commits in third_party/rttr/COMMITS) with the user
 interface removed and the changes listed in THIRD_PARTY.md. No data of the
 original game is part of the source or the package.

